mini-DSH

The README records that this repository's tutorial baseline is
https://github.com/huangjunsen0406/mini-dsh through commit c5fc9c4, and that
independent extensions start at commit 43e3829. The baseline repository is
MIT-licensed; its copyright notice is preserved in LICENSE.

The historical commit authors "CodexSandboxOffline" and "unknown" are not
mapped to a person in this repository. No .mailmap or history rewrite is
performed without an explicit identity confirmation.

Runtime dependencies retain their own licenses. The direct dependencies are
@deepseek-ai/cordis (MIT), @deepseek-ai/dsh-mcp-client (MIT), and dotenv
(BSD-2-Clause). Development dependencies (TypeScript, Biome, @types/node) are
not shipped in the package.

The synthetic evidence under docs/samples/ is generated from this repository's
scripted fixtures. It contains no real user prompt, provider response, or
private tool output. The historical NX-45 raw run remains private and is not
republished by this notice.
